  "question": {
    "text": "An electromagnetic wave is propagating along $X$-axis. At $x=1 \\mathrm{~cm}$ and $t=18 \\mathrm{~s}$, its electric vector $|E|=8 \\mathrm{~V} / \\mathrm{m}$, then the magnitude of its magnetic vector is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\r\n$266 \\times 10^{-8}$\r\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\r\n$3 \\times 10^{-7}$\r\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\r\n$3.14 \\times 10^{-8}$\r\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\r\n$3.16 \\times 10^{-7}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "As we know that, $\\frac{E}{B}=c$\r\n$$\r\n\\text { so, } B=\\frac{E}{c}=\\frac{8}{3 \\times 10^8}=2.66 \\times 10^{-8}\r\n$$"
  }
}